# NEVER track private keys in this directory. Even the dev-mode fallback
# key must stay local — production signing lives in OCI Vault.
#
# regen-dev-cert.sh regenerates everything below from scratch, which is
# why none of it is tracked: signer.key (the ES256 private key),
# signer.pem (leaf + root chain, in the order c2pa-rs expects) and
# signer-root.pem. A fresh clone therefore has NO signing material and
# signAsset() refuses at its cert/key guard until the script is run.
# lib/c2pa/formats.ts's tests and services/c2pa-signer/tests run it for
# themselves rather than skipping.
signer.key
signer.pem
signer-root.pem
